# Open Morbital — Environment Variables
# Copy this to .env and fill in real values. Never commit .env.
#
# Open Morbital is local-first and does not require any environment variables
# to run. This file exists so forks adding cloud features (sync, login,
# analytics) have a place to declare their variable names. Until you add
# something here, you can run the app without an .env file at all.
